<title>THAILAND: Siam Commercial Bank unaudited 1996 net up.</title>
<headline>Siam Commercial Bank unaudited 1996 net up.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for the year ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				 Second half</p>
<p>				   1996		     1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		12.40	 vs	  n/a</p>
<p>    Net		    4,721.20	 vs    4,013.10</p>
<p>				   Year</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		23.68	 vs	  n/a</p>
<p>    Net		    9,014.60	 vs    7,754.60</p>
<p>Notes: Fourth quarter figures not stated. Comparative earnings per share not given, but company said the six month per share figure was a 17.42 percent rise over the same period a year ago. It said the year per share figure was 16.08 percent higher than the same period last year. Siam Commercial Bank is one of Thailand's largest banks in terms of assets.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
</text>
